Use of Spring Beans
Why do we use Spring Beans instead of creating objects with new?

ANSWER = To let Spring manage dependencies and object lifecycle
Spring handles object creation, dependency injection, and lifecycle management.

###############$$#
Use of Primary
When do we use @Primary?

ANSWER = When multiple implementations exist and one should be the default
@Primary tells Spring which bean to choose by default.

